//! BabyBear authentication for the generated high-precision sparse AIR trace.
//!
//! This layer commits the exact base rows, canonical padding, and quartic copy
//! interactions emitted by `mandelbrot_proof_fixed_air_core`. Its production
//! transcript begins by committing the base LDE, then derives interaction
//! challenges from that typed root before committing the interaction LDE.
//! The recursive leaf statement and both roots then derive one composition
//! challenge and codeword through the shared BabyBear proof vocabulary. It
//! deliberately does not call the current result a complete FRI receipt:
//! authenticated public-boundary openings, queries, and FRI still have to bind
//! these columns before sparse authentication becomes a recursive proof.

